## How the brand is founded

At first the idea of plush came really strong to my mind. If we are a plush creative + manufacturing company, why not build an IP ourselves? Therefore, I transformed the direction from a professional, bold logo text into my journey of discovering the design of our mascot.

![](/images/experience/kedonia/image.webp)

## AI Plush Generation

A seamless workflow for user to generate, iterate and order under 2 minutes. Turning curiosity into conversions.

![](/images/experience/kedonia/image-1.webp)

